{
  "_comment": "Copy to bootstrap.config.local.json (git-ignored) and fill in. This file holds ONLY non-secret identifiers. Secrets are never stored here - the bootstrap prompts for them with hidden input and writes them straight to AWS Secrets Manager, EAS, or GitHub environment secrets.",

